## Workspace Structure

Bootstrap creates only the files below. All content directories are created
on demand by the skill that first writes into them.

```
{{project_name}}/
├── AGENTS.md                 # Project instructions [bootstrap]
└── .omr/
    └── tree-state.json       # Skill tree progress [bootstrap]

# Created on demand when needed:
# raw/papers|web|github|datasets|search|failed   [omr-collection]
# docs/index/*.json                              [omr-collection / omr-idea-note]
# docs/ideas/                                    [omr-idea-note]
# docs/plans/                                    [omr-analyze / omr-decision / omr-evaluation]
# docs/archive/                                  [omr-reconcile]
# docs/survey|report|manuscript|brief/           [omr-synthesis]
# wiki/                                          [omr-synthesis]
# src/                                           [omr-evaluation]
# .omr/patterns/                                 [pattern save]
```

**Note:** Static contracts, schemas, and built-in patterns stay in the installed
`omr-core` skill. Do not copy skills into the workspace.

